{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">江美儀與郭柏妍因拍攝TVB劇集《下流上車族》飾演母女而結緣，兩人不僅在戲內默契十足，戲外亦建立了深厚的感情。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">即使《下流上車族》已經播畢，她們依然保持緊密聯絡，只要一有時間便會抽空相約聚會。日前，江美儀在社交平台上載了一張與郭柏妍的合照，並溫馨發文寫道：「兩母女係要見吓面食個飯傾吓偈飲埋同一杯野嘅！Love u 芊芊！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2cc5b283-0a53-4a76-bea1-a9113f49ad5a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026hmE2xyrfba1786330874.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2cc5b283-0a53-4a76-bea1-a9113f49ad5a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8a334f71-b985-417e-813d-ba419a5c9f2e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026wpJYwVt6Bh1786330874.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8a334f71-b985-417e-813d-ba419a5c9f2e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從相片中可見，江美儀開心地搭著「阿女」郭柏妍的肩膀合照，兩人更親密地「一杯嘢飲兩份飲」，足見她們私底下的感情極為要好，猶如真正的母女一般。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這張合照曝光後，隨即引來大批網民留言讚好。不少粉絲紛紛代入劇中角色留言呼喚「車太同芊芊」，也有人感嘆「芊芊長大了」，更有劇迷激動直呼「《下流上車族》回憶返晒嚟」，掀起了一陣劇集回憶殺！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T07:20:49.214659+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}